From: Asius <dev@asius.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: enable Dragon external USB recovery

Limit the AGNOS-derived host recovery and receiver-detection sequencing
quirks to the external Dragon controller. The internal Wi-Fi/BT controller
and the NCM gadget path retain their existing behavior.

Signed-off-by: Asius <dev@asius.ai>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
@@ -1326,6 +1326,8 @@
 &usb_1 {
 	status = "okay";
 	dr_mode = "host";
+	snps,dis-rxdet-u3-quirk;
+	xhci-missing-cas-quirk;
 };
 
 &usb_1_dwc3_hs {
